[node name="DescriptionLabel" parent="ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer/alignments" instance=ExtResource( 2 )]
margin_right = 200.0
margin_bottom = 22.0
hint_tooltip = "Property: alignments

Define new alignments that the mod adds here.

Alignments are a limitation for hardpoint equipment to only add directional equipment to slots that would not cause issues. E.g. ALIGNMENT_LEFT only permits the left facing cargo containers to the hardpoint.

Equipment without an alignment are added regardless of the slot alignment."
text = "alignments"
property_tooltip = "Define new alignments that the mod adds here.

Alignments are a limitation for hardpoint equipment to only add directional equipment to slots that would not cause issues. E.g. ALIGNMENT_LEFT only permits the left facing cargo containers to the hardpoint.

Equipment without an alignment are added regardless of the slot alignment."

