[node name="DescriptionLabel" parent="ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer/slot_defaults" instance=ExtResource( 2 )]
margin_right = 200.0
margin_bottom = 22.0
hint_tooltip = "Property: slot_defaults

Define new slot defaults that the mod adds here.

Equipment defined here will be the base equipment tags that the slot will have access to before handling overrides.

If you add a slot that already defines defaults (either built-in or from another mod), then all equipment tags not already in the slot default will be added."
text = "slot_defaults"
property_tooltip = "Define new slot defaults that the mod adds here.

